      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "能請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳替我顧店嗎？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n如果<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳能幫我好好顧店，\n獎勵會很豐厚的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "80FD8ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B366FF621198675E9755CEFF1F00100001BE01000A5982679C00100003110000FF01014F6059B380FD5E6B6211597D597D98675E97FF0C000A734E52F567035F888C50539A7684FF0100100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳準備好要顧店了，\n就請跟我說一聲喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
