      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "73FE57284E0D65B94FBF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊啊！好擔心家裡啊！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n讓凍脊龍自己看家，\n家裡說不定會凍得硬梆梆！？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
