      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好猶豫……\n以現在的心情來說，好像該選美味之水。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
