      "offsetInSection": 2708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "E300003400390037003000300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳是個算數小天才嘛！\n我會再來的，到時就拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳囉。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 2724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B3662F500B7B9765785C0F5929624D561BFF01000A62116703518D4F867684FF0C523066425C3162DC8A1700100003110000FF01014F6059B356C930020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳讓人有點小失望耶。\n我會再來的，到時就拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳囉。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 2800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B38B934EBA67099EDE5C0F5931671B80363002000A62116703518D4F867684FF0C523066425C3162DC8A1700100003110000FF01014F6059B356C930020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "辛苦了！\n謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳幫我顧店。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 2876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8F9B82E64E86FF01000A8B1D8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B35E6B621198675E97300200100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼，我們就來確認\n商品和營業額吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 2924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39EBCFF0C621150115C314F8678BA8A8D000A554654C1548C71DF696D984D5427300200100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "欸～！<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳可能不適合顧店。\n以顧店級別來說是Z級耶。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 2972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6B38FF5EFF0100100003110000FF01014F6059B353EF80FD4E0D9069540898675E973002000A4EE598675E977D1A52254F868AAA662F005A7D1A8036300200100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "唔唔唔，\n忽然要顧店可能太勉強<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 3044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "551455145514FF0C000A5FFD7136898198675E9753EF80FD592A52C95F3700100003110000FF01014F6059B34E86300200100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "作為顧店的人來說，\n感覺有一點吃力呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 3104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F5C70BA98675E9776844EBA4F868AAAFF0C000A611F89BA67094E009EDE5403529B5462300200100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看來<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳顧店算是顧得普普通通呢。\n普通可不是什麼壞事喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 3152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B4F8600100003110000FF01014F6059B398675E977B97662F98675F97666E666E901A901A54623002000A666E901A53EF4E0D662F4EC09EBC58DE4E8B5594300200100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看來<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳顧店顧得相當出色喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 3228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B4F8600100003110000FF01014F6059B398675E9798675F9776F8757651FA82725594300200100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不妙！好厲害！\n我遇到顧店的勁敵了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 3276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D5999FF01597D53B25BB3FF01000A62119047523098675E97768452C165754E86FF0100100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>得到了\n<U+E300><U+0010><U+0003>Ȅ<U+0002><U+0000>作為獎勵！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 3324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000005F9752304E86000AE300001000030204000200004F5C70BA734E52F5FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "負責看家的凍脊龍把家裡\n冰封起來也變得挺涼快的了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 3364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8CA08CAC770B5BB6768451CD810A9F8D628A5BB688E1000A51B05C018D774F864E5F8B8A5F97633A6DBC5FEB76844E86300200100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "總之<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳幫了我大忙！\n下次歡迎<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳來當客人喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 3424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7E3D4E4B00100003110000FF01014F6059B35E6B4E86621159275FD9FF01000A4E0B6B216B618FCE00100003110000FF01014F6059B34F8675765BA24EBA5594300200100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要趁現在\n查看商品的價格嗎？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 3500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89818D8173FE5728000A67E5770B554654C1768450F9683C55CEFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "查看",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 3532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67E5770B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不要",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 3540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D89810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "美味之水　<U+E300>200\n勁爽汽水　<U+E300>300<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n果汁牛奶　<U+E300>400\n哞哞鮮奶　<U+E300>600",
